# PART 2 — CREATE STUDENT VALIDATION RULES

---

# STEP 5 — Marks Validation Rule

Go:

* Validation Rules
* New

Rule Name:

```text id="8nj3lp"
Marks_Validation
```

Formula:

```text id="jlwm4p"
OR(
    Marks__c < 0,
    Marks__c > 100
)
```

Error Message:

```text id="c9v7wq"
Marks must be between 0 and 100
```

Save.

---

# STEP 6 — Roll Number Validation Rule

Rule Name:

```text id="jlwm6p"
Roll_Number_Validation
```

Formula:

```text id="jlwm8r"
Roll_Number__c <= 0
```

Error Message:

```text id="4x8pkm"
Roll Number must be greater than 0
```

Save.

---

# STEP 7 — Student Name Validation Rule

Rule Name:

```text id="m3q9vw"
Student_Name_Validation
```

Formula:

```text id="jlwm2p"
ISBLANK(Name)
```

Error Message:

```text id="x6r1kb"
Student Name cannot be blank
```

Save.

---

# STEP 8 — Student Email Validation Rule

Rule Name:

```text id="w0k2qn"
Student_Email_Validation
```

Formula:

```text id="jlwm5p"
NOT(
    CONTAINS(
        Email__c,
        "@"
    )
)
```

Error Message:

```text id="h9y7ld"
Email must contain @ symbol
```

Save.

