# IMPORTANT VIVA QUESTIONS

## What is Validation Rule?

A validation rule prevents invalid data from being saved into Salesforce objects.

---

## What is Lightning App?

A Lightning App is a collection of tabs, objects, and pages grouped together.

---

## What is Custom Object?

A custom object is a user-created database table in Salesforce.

---

## Why use Validation Rules?

To ensure data accuracy and prevent invalid records.
